1
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:38,050
The responsibility of serving
as Ningcheng Chamber of Commerce's

2
00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:39,380
next vice president is now yours.

3
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:40,900
Make sure you work hard.

4
00:00:41,770 --> 00:00:43,570
I won't let you down, President.

5
00:00:49,450 --> 00:00:50,220
Here.

6
00:00:53,290 --> 00:00:55,550
[Eclipse in the Lost City]
[Episode 15]

7
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:59,320
What do you get out of Xu Qingdao
becoming vice president?

8
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:01,300
You didn't get the territory
on East Street either, did you?

9
00:01:01,300 --> 00:01:03,230
So you'd better keep a low profile,

10
00:01:03,290 --> 00:01:04,819
or you might get kicked out.

11
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:06,640
Bullshit!

12
00:01:06,730 --> 00:01:08,600
Since when did our Shisha Gang's business

13
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:10,960
become any of your business?

14
00:01:12,539 --> 00:01:13,340
Fair point.

15
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:15,300
He's just a vice president,

16
00:01:15,300 --> 00:01:16,660
answering to the president,

17
00:01:16,660 --> 00:01:19,590
and nothing but a dog
for the foreigners backing him.

18
00:01:19,980 --> 00:01:21,580
With the chief in this state,

19
00:01:21,820 --> 00:01:23,680
you probably won't get anything.

20
00:01:28,250 --> 00:01:29,010
Lu Ye,

21
00:01:29,039 --> 00:01:30,880
you listen up.

22
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:33,410
The chamber of commerce president
is nothing.

23
00:01:33,410 --> 00:01:35,560
And those foreigners are nothing, either.

24
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:37,020
If they don't listen to me,

25
00:01:37,110 --> 00:01:38,270
I'll kill them!

26
00:01:38,759 --> 00:01:39,500
Go quickly.

27
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:41,740
When our chief becomes the president,

28
00:01:42,170 --> 00:01:45,289
the whole territory will belong
to the Shisha Gang.

29
00:01:45,940 --> 00:01:49,460
And everyone in Ningcheng
will be bowing at our feet.

30
00:01:49,460 --> 00:01:49,900
I...

31
00:01:50,930 --> 00:01:54,460
We'll discuss the vice-presidential
election at a later date.

32
00:01:54,830 --> 00:01:56,270
President.

33
00:01:56,330 --> 00:01:56,860
Let's go.

34
00:01:56,870 --> 00:01:57,530
President.

35
00:01:57,539 --> 00:01:58,500
Let me explain.

36
00:01:58,780 --> 00:02:00,340
President, this is a misunderstanding.

37
00:02:00,340 --> 00:02:01,000
President.

38
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:02,690
Ten o'clock.

39
00:02:03,430 --> 00:02:04,270
Right on time.

40
00:02:09,259 --> 00:02:10,389
That was brilliant.

41
00:02:11,020 --> 00:02:13,540
Everyone in Ningcheng knows now.

42
00:02:15,300 --> 00:02:16,500
I'm afraid Xu Qingdao

43
00:02:17,340 --> 00:02:19,000
won't be president after all.

44
00:02:20,180 --> 00:02:20,940
You...

45
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:21,780
You.

46
00:02:22,780 --> 00:02:23,780
I'll kill you!

47
00:02:23,780 --> 00:02:24,840
Put the knife down.

48
00:02:25,750 --> 00:02:26,550
Don't move.

49
00:02:27,290 --> 00:02:28,490
If you want to live.

50
00:02:50,500 --> 00:02:51,780
Xu.

51
00:02:51,850 --> 00:02:52,770
I'm sorry.

52
00:02:53,070 --> 00:02:54,460
As for the Chamber of Commerce president,

53
00:02:54,460 --> 00:02:56,180
I've tried my best,

54
00:02:56,340 --> 00:02:57,740
but it still didn't work.

55
00:02:58,700 --> 00:02:59,670
I know.

56
00:03:00,340 --> 00:03:02,540
It's the Shisha Gang's fault this time.

57
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,400
I accept it.

58
00:03:04,810 --> 00:03:08,170
I agreed to give up an extra 30%
of the profits every year.

59
00:03:09,140 --> 00:03:10,670
Is that not sincere enough?

60
00:03:10,750 --> 00:03:12,870
I heard they were wavering at first,

61
00:03:13,700 --> 00:03:16,010
but I didn't expect a big shot
to intervene behind the scenes.

62
00:03:16,010 --> 00:03:16,970
Qingdao.

63
00:03:17,420 --> 00:03:19,079
There's nothing more I can do.

64
00:03:19,350 --> 00:03:22,110
You definitely won't be the president.

65
00:03:30,750 --> 00:03:31,550
Come in.

66
00:03:41,620 --> 00:03:42,540
Tianbai.

67
00:03:43,340 --> 00:03:45,540
Hui made a mistake this time

68
00:03:45,980 --> 00:03:47,220
and ruined my plan.

69
00:03:47,820 --> 00:03:49,980
He deserves to suffer a bit in prison.

70
00:03:50,500 --> 00:03:52,460
But now, Hui is gone.

71
00:03:52,820 --> 00:03:55,650
The Shisha Gang has too many people
and too many things to handle.

72
00:03:55,650 --> 00:03:57,950
I need someone capable
and loyal at my side.

73
00:03:57,950 --> 00:03:58,670
Chief,

74
00:03:58,690 --> 00:04:00,090
what do you mean?

75
00:04:00,460 --> 00:04:02,620
It's not an easy position to hold,

76
00:04:05,490 --> 00:04:07,930
but it puts you closest to me.

77
00:04:09,660 --> 00:04:11,260
I've always had faith in you.

78
00:04:11,940 --> 00:04:13,380
Don't let me down.

79
00:04:15,450 --> 00:04:16,250
Yes.

80
00:04:20,230 --> 00:04:21,230
Sir.

81
00:04:21,540 --> 00:04:22,800
I've already given the word.

82
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:26,180
Xu Qingdao won't be able to enter
the Ningcheng Chamber of Commerce.

83
00:04:26,180 --> 00:04:27,140
Got it.

84
00:04:35,020 --> 00:04:37,170
Xu Qingdao, oh, Xu Qingdao.

85
00:04:37,740 --> 00:04:39,500
You've really grown bold.

86
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:44,320
Daring to pull these little tricks
right under my nose?

87
00:04:50,820 --> 00:04:51,880
Congratulations.

88
00:04:52,420 --> 00:04:53,880
You've moved up the ranks.

89
00:04:55,180 --> 00:04:56,020
Thanks to you.

90
00:04:57,980 --> 00:05:00,100
And there's plenty more coming your way.

91
00:05:00,100 --> 00:05:02,470
Have you figured out
what the different numbers

92
00:05:02,470 --> 00:05:04,380
on those maintenance doses meant?

93
00:05:04,380 --> 00:05:05,060
No.

94
00:05:05,260 --> 00:05:07,180
I've only seen No. 1 and No. 2.

95
00:05:07,580 --> 00:05:09,380
I don't know if there are others.

96
00:05:09,660 --> 00:05:10,420
By the way,

97
00:05:10,900 --> 00:05:12,500
I've checked with my master.

98
00:05:12,940 --> 00:05:16,400
The test results from the materials
left in the warehouse show

99
00:05:19,180 --> 00:05:21,710
that your father
was transporting Wolfbane.

100
00:05:22,500 --> 00:05:23,760
Looking at it this way,

101
00:05:24,620 --> 00:05:26,100
it all ties together now.

102
00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:30,180
But somehow, things have
only gotten murkier.

103
00:05:32,340 --> 00:05:33,020
Forget it.

104
00:05:33,740 --> 00:05:34,400
Never mind.

105
00:05:36,220 --> 00:05:37,740
Let's just celebrate for now.

106
00:05:37,740 --> 00:05:38,540
Celebrate?

107
00:05:38,980 --> 00:05:39,940
Celebrate what?

108
00:05:41,180 --> 00:05:44,580
We're one step closer to our goal.

109
00:05:57,320 --> 00:05:57,850
Come on.

110
00:05:58,010 --> 00:05:58,810
Cheers.

111
00:06:08,770 --> 00:06:10,940
I told you I'd help you move up the ranks.

112
00:06:10,940 --> 00:06:12,140
I always keep my word.

113
00:06:14,500 --> 00:06:15,300
Shen Tianbai,

114
00:06:16,060 --> 00:06:17,940
has your master caught

115
00:06:18,700 --> 00:06:20,700
the mole in your police station yet?

116
00:06:21,340 --> 00:06:21,840
No.

117
00:06:24,090 --> 00:06:27,210
Ningcheng sure has some fine cops.

118
00:06:35,659 --> 00:06:36,860
If you find out

119
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:41,280
that the mole was someone you trusted,

120
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:43,640
what would you do?

121
00:06:45,180 --> 00:06:46,110
What do you mean?

122
00:06:47,460 --> 00:06:48,659
Let me put it this way.

123
00:06:49,260 --> 00:06:50,380
What if one day,

124
00:06:51,080 --> 00:06:53,090
you found out that someone you trusted

125
00:06:53,090 --> 00:06:55,740
had done something
you just couldn't understand?

126
00:06:55,740 --> 00:06:56,620
You trust him,

127
00:06:57,180 --> 00:06:59,050
but you still can't understand
why he'd do it.

128
00:06:59,050 --> 00:07:00,050
What would you do?

129
00:07:02,220 --> 00:07:03,020
Your father.

130
00:07:06,980 --> 00:07:10,020
I really want to know why.

131
00:07:12,380 --> 00:07:13,460
Why?

132
00:07:17,820 --> 00:07:19,150
I'll find out the truth.

133
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:27,480
Me too.

134
00:07:29,810 --> 00:07:30,530
Cheers.

135
00:08:46,540 --> 00:08:47,340
Young Master.

136
00:08:47,780 --> 00:08:48,380
Young...

137
00:08:50,180 --> 00:08:51,780
Young Master.

138
00:08:52,140 --> 00:08:53,820
Wake up. We've got a new lead.

139
00:08:55,090 --> 00:08:55,840
Young Master.

140
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:57,790
The owner of a money house
we looked into before

141
00:08:57,790 --> 00:08:59,850
has brought us some new information.

142
00:09:00,260 --> 00:09:02,390
It's related to the old chief's death.

143
00:09:03,400 --> 00:09:04,900
Why didn't he tell us before?

144
00:09:04,900 --> 00:09:07,260
The boss said he was afraid
they'd come after him,

145
00:09:07,260 --> 00:09:08,190
so he kept quiet.

146
00:09:08,380 --> 00:09:09,900
He thought he could get away with it.

147
00:09:09,900 --> 00:09:12,180
But lately, he's been having nightmares,

148
00:09:12,180 --> 00:09:14,420
dreaming that the old chief
is standing at his bedside.

149
00:09:14,420 --> 00:09:15,820
He's too scared to sleep.

150
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:18,620
His family has been falling sick
one after another,

151
00:09:18,620 --> 00:09:20,300
and he's nearly gone through
all his savings.

152
00:09:20,300 --> 00:09:21,700
He thinks it's karma,

153
00:09:21,820 --> 00:09:23,500
so he was scared enough to come clean.

154
00:09:23,500 --> 00:09:24,300
Karma?

155
00:09:25,190 --> 00:09:26,920
What did he do to feel so guilty?

156
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,490
He covered up a transaction.

157
00:09:28,490 --> 00:09:30,350
A week before the old chief died,

158
00:09:30,380 --> 00:09:32,380
he transferred a large sum of money.

159
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:35,240
He said the old chief
looked panicked at the time,

160
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:37,760
like someone had forced him to do it.

161
00:09:38,210 --> 00:09:39,610
Who did he transfer it to?

162
00:09:40,890 --> 00:09:41,690
Look.

163
00:09:43,980 --> 00:09:44,780
Wu Ren.

164
00:10:10,580 --> 00:10:11,380
You're here.

165
00:10:13,250 --> 00:10:14,670
Look at this handwriting.

166
00:10:14,670 --> 00:10:15,800
Do you recognize it?

167
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:23,120
This is...

168
00:10:25,020 --> 00:10:26,750
This is my master's signature.

169
00:10:26,940 --> 00:10:28,070
Since you said that,

170
00:10:28,620 --> 00:10:29,750
then it must be true.

171
00:10:30,300 --> 00:10:31,830
Look closely at this draft.

172
00:10:33,900 --> 00:10:34,780
So much money.

173
00:10:37,490 --> 00:10:40,220
You suspect he's the mole
who killed your father?

174
00:10:40,660 --> 00:10:41,460
Shen Tianbai.

175
00:10:43,740 --> 00:10:47,020
What is your answer now?

176
00:10:49,180 --> 00:10:51,540
But I have another condition.

177
00:10:53,620 --> 00:10:54,420
Go ahead.

178
00:10:54,750 --> 00:10:56,510
Whatever it takes,

179
00:10:57,340 --> 00:10:59,500
bring Lu Ye to me.

180
00:10:59,920 --> 00:11:00,720
What?

181
00:11:00,850 --> 00:11:02,650
He screwed up my plans.

182
00:11:03,140 --> 00:11:05,780
I need to settle the score with him.

183
00:11:06,900 --> 00:11:07,700
Lu Ye.

184
00:11:08,420 --> 00:11:09,220
I'm sorry.

185
00:11:25,430 --> 00:11:27,750
Young Master Lu is awake.

186
00:11:28,870 --> 00:11:29,670
Where am I?

187
00:11:30,340 --> 00:11:32,380
This is the water dungeon
of the Shisha Gang.

188
00:11:32,380 --> 00:11:33,800
I had this prepared especially for you.

189
00:11:33,800 --> 00:11:34,800
Do you like it?

190
00:11:44,690 --> 00:11:45,490
Shen Tianbai.

191
00:11:46,060 --> 00:11:47,180
It's you.
